### Bug Description and Root Cause

The issue mentioned in the bug report is related to the color contrast of the cancel search icon button when using the search component in Chrome. The screenshot indicates that the autofill background color in Chrome, which is `skyblue`, causes the icon to have insufficient contrast, making it difficult to see.

### Bug Location and Fix

The root cause is that the search component’s styles do not consider the `skyblue` autofill background used by Chrome. To fix this, we need to add a CSS rule to override Chrome’s autofill background color and text color in the search component.

